State park peace officers-definition and scope
SF0004
of authority.
Sponsored By: Joint Travel, Recreation, Wildlife & Cultural
Resources Interim Committee
AN ACT relating to criminal procedure; amending the definition of peace officer
to clarify and expand the scope of authority for park rangers, superintendents
and assistant superintendents; making conforming amendments; and providing for
an effective date.
